  (text "POWER + MCU. USB-C is the only supply and programmer (native USB-Serial-JTAG on IO12/IO13). Relay drives on IO21/22/23/3 only. Strapping: IO8 high (LED pull-up), IO9 BOOT, IO15 LED pull-up."
    (at 30 30 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e437fe2c-74a1-4efe-ac73-792777b548bc")
  )
  (text "OLED header: JP1/JP2 select pin-1/2 order (GND,VCC default). JP3 selects OLED VCC 3V3 (default) or 5V. Qwiic = GND,3V3,SDA,SCL."
    (at 30 150 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "f86cd923-c66a-48a7-8b50-e8c2cdd69ed1")
  )
